{"type":"text","timestamp":1788228553066,"sessionID":"ses_fa54e4cfeffeF35792XylHPXI3","part":{"id":"prt_05aba3c39001AGGA49yc3dLJBJ","messageID":"msg_05ab9b764001MGpD31Mwh510ap","sessionID":"ses_fa54e4cfeffeF35792XylHPXI3","type":"text","text":"Now I have the full picture. Fixes needed:\n1. **Dedup** — overlapping sources record the same fixture a day apart → duplicated matches inflate standings\n2. **Derby search** — compares raw display names against team keys (always empty) + one wrongly-ordered DERBIES entry\n3. **Stage filter** — \"final\" substring-matches \"semifinals\"\n4. **Tests** — none exist (R12)\n\nFixing dedup first:","time":{"start":1788228549689,"end":1788228553065}}}
