derbies: use identity keys on match side and derby keys from sorted identity keys of DERBIES entries.\n\n### Fix 3: stage/round filter exact-first.\n\n### Fix 4: club alias matching for players (get_club_overview + search_players club).\n\n### Fix 5: TESTS — create tests/ with pytest covering all requirements R3-R12.\n\nLet me also double-check `get_standings` completeness after dedup fix: 2019 should be complete with 38 games per team and Flamengo ~90 pts.\n\nAlso potential issue: `_deduplicate` currently only dedups when `match.date` is set. BR-Football rows where date fails parsing? BR-Football dates look like \"14/04/2014\"? Let me check the date column format quickly. Earlier parse worked (dates like 2019-04-28 came out). Some rows might have unparseable dates → they skip dedup. Acceptable.\n\nOne more check — the Brasileirao_Matches.csv datetime format: \"2012-05-19 18:30:00\" presumably parses ✓.\n\nNow about `get_standings` for Libertadores/Cup — not applicable (knockouts), fine, tool says league standings.\n\nAlso the note in server INSTRUCTIONS mentions date range \"Brasileirão (2012-2022 + historical 2003-2019)\". After dedup the coverage will still be the same.\n\nLet me now check `identity_key` for a couple of cross-source pairs to be sure dedup works: e.g. novo \"Flamengo\" vs BR-Football \"Flamengo\" — same. But novo uses names like \"Internacional\" vs BR-Football \"Internacional-RS\"→ normalized \"Internacional\" ✓.\n\nWait, actually there's one more thing to verify — in `_load_matches`, sorting happens BEFORE `_canonicalize_teams` and `_deduplicate`? No: load → canonicalize → dedup → indexes. Sorting first is fine.\n\nPotential subtle issue in `_canonicalize_teams`: display name selection is by frequency; identity \"internacional\" most frequent display could be \"Internacional\" ✓.\n\nLet me now also confirm: does `_pair_record` in search_matches with team+opponent give correct results — used pair equality via set comparison {home,away} == {a,b} ✓.\n\nNow implement the fixes. First, dedup rewrite in data_loader.py.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05aba4961001nolUm1awMOg6Q6","sessionID":"ses_fa54e4cfeffeF35792XylHPXI3","messageID":"msg_05ab9b764001MGpD31Mwh510ap"}}
