{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788228831328,"sessionID":"ses_fa54e4cfeffeF35792XylHPXI3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_5e76f9d7f6d04b2a9a3bd57f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"./venv/bin/python << 'EOF'\nimport csv, sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.normalize import identity_key, parse_date\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.data_loader import Dataset, Match\n\nds = Dataset.__new__(Dataset)\nds.data_dir = Dataset().data_dir\n# re-run loader manually to capture pre/post dedup\nds.matches = []\nds.players = []\nds._identity_to_display = {}\nds._load_matches()\nds._canonicalize_teams()\npre = ds.matches\nds._deduplicate()\npost_keys = set()\nfor m in ds.matches:\n    if m.date and m.season is not None:\n        post_keys.add((m.competition, m.season, identity_key(m.home_team), identity_key(m.away_team), m.date))\n\n# reconstruct which were dropped: re-run dedup logic but track\nds2 = Dataset.__new__(Dataset)\nds2.matches = []\nds2.players = []\nds2._identity_to_display = {}\nds2._load_matches()\nds2._canonicalize_teams()\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.data_loader import Dataset as D\npriority = {n:i for i,n in enumerate(D._SOURCES)}\nseen = {}\ndropped = []\nkept = []\nfor match in ds2.matches:\n    if not match.date or match.season is None:\n        kept.append(match); continue\n    key = (match.competition, match.season, identity_key(match.home_team), identity_key(match.away_team))\n    md = parse_date(match.date)\n    rank = priority.get(match.source, 99)\n    ex = seen.get(key)\n    if ex and md and ex[0] and abs((md-ex[0]).days) <= 3:\n        dropped.append((ex[2], match))\n        if rank < ex[1]:\n            kept[ex[3]] = match; seen[key] = (md, rank, ex[3])\n        continue\n    seen[key] = (md, rank, len(kept))\n    kept.append(match)\n\ndiff_goals = 0\nfor kept_m, dropped_m in dropped:\n    if (kept_m.home_goals, kept_m.away_goals) != (dropped_m.home_goals, dropped_m.away_goals):\n        diff_goals += 1\nprint('dropped:', len(dropped), '| dropped with differing score:', diff_goals)\nfor pair in dropped:\n    k, d = pair\n    if (k.home_goals,k.away_goals)!=(d.home_goals,d.away_goals):\n        print('  kept:', k.date, k.competition, k.season, k.home_team, k.home_goals,'-',k.away_goals, k.away_team, '|', k.source)\n        print('  drop:', d.date, d.competition, d.season, d.home_team, d.home_goals,'-',d.away_goals, d.away_team, '|', d.source)\n        break\nEOF"},"output":"Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 26, in <module>\n  File \"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-75154ofp/retort-242ce4667ad2/brazilian_soccer_mcp/data_loader.py\", line 143, in _load_matches\n    {\n  File \"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-75154ofp/retort-242ce4667ad2/brazilian_soccer_mcp/data_loader.py\", line 175, in _load_historical\n    path = self.data_dir / \"novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv\"\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: 'Dataset' object has no attribute 'data_dir'\n","metadata":{"output":"Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 26, in <module>\n  File \"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-75154ofp/retort-242ce4667ad2/brazilian_soccer_mcp/data_loader.py\", line 143, in _load_matches\n    {\n  File \"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-75154ofp/retort-242ce4667ad2/brazilian_soccer_mcp/data_loader.py\", line 175, in _load_historical\n    path = self.data_dir / \"novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv\"\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: 'Dataset' object has no attribute 'data_dir'\n","exit":1,"truncated":false},"title":"./venv/bin/python << 'EOF'\nimport csv, sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.normalize import identity_key, parse_date\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.data_loader import Dataset, Match\n\nds = Dataset.__new__(Dataset)\nds.data_dir = Dataset().data_dir\n# re-run loader manually to capture pre/post dedup\nds.matches = []\nds.players = []\nds._identity_to_display = {}\nds._load_matches()\nds._canonicalize_teams()\npre = ds.matches\nds._deduplicate()\npost_keys = set()\nfor m in ds.matches:\n    if m.date and m.season is not None:\n        post_keys.add((m.competition, m.season, identity_key(m.home_team), identity_key(m.away_team), m.date))\n\n# reconstruct which were dropped: re-run dedup logic but track\nds2 = Dataset.__new__(Dataset)\nds2.matches = []\nds2.players = []\nds2._identity_to_display = {}\nds2._load_matches()\nds2._canonicalize_teams()\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.data_loader import Dataset as D\npriority = {n:i for i,n in enumerate(D._SOURCES)}\nseen = {}\ndropped = []\nkept = []\nfor match in ds2.matches:\n    if not match.date or match.season is None:\n        kept.append(match); continue\n    key = (match.competition, match.season, identity_key(match.home_team), identity_key(match.away_team))\n    md = parse_date(match.date)\n    rank = priority.get(match.source, 99)\n    ex = seen.get(key)\n    if ex and md and ex[0] and abs((md-ex[0]).days) <= 3:\n        dropped.append((ex[2], match))\n        if rank < ex[1]:\n            kept[ex[3]] = match; seen[key] = (md, rank, ex[3])\n        continue\n    seen[key] = (md, rank, len(kept))\n    kept.append(match)\n\ndiff_goals = 0\nfor kept_m, dropped_m in dropped:\n    if (kept_m.home_goals, kept_m.away_goals) != (dropped_m.home_goals, dropped_m.away_goals):\n        diff_goals += 1\nprint('dropped:', len(dropped), '| dropped with differing score:', diff_goals)\nfor pair in dropped:\n    k, d = pair\n    if (k.home_goals,k.away_goals)!=(d.home_goals,d.away_goals):\n        print('  kept:', k.date, k.competition, k.season, k.home_team, k.home_goals,'-',k.away_goals, k.away_team, '|', k.source)\n        print('  drop:', d.date, d.competition, d.season, d.home_team, d.home_goals,'-',d.away_goals, d.away_team, '|', d.source)\n        break\nEOF","time":{"start":1788228831316,"end":1788228831326}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Excellent! All fixed:\n- 2019 standings: Flamengo 90 pts / 38 games, complete ✓ (matches reality: Flamengo 90, Santos 74, Palmeiras 74 — exactly the real 2019 table!)\n- Derbies found ✓\n- Libertadores 2019 final: Flamengo 2-1 River Plate ✓ (real result!)\n- FIFA squads work via aliases ✓\n\nThe dedup dropped 18163-17049 = 1114 duplicate matches. Let me sanity-check the dedup isn't over-dropping legitimate matches: e.g., Serie B 2019 should have 38 rounds × 20 teams = 380 matches. Let me verify a few season counts and compare-team counts. Also check Copa do Brasil — two-legged ties: same ordered pair shouldn't recur within 3 days... Actually wait: could a Copa do Brasil tie have BOTH legs within 3 days? Unlikely (typically weeks apart). But what about rescheduled league matches — a postponed match played days after the scheduled one, with both recorded? Sources record final date typically.\n\nOne risk: BR-Football contains 'Serie A' 2014-2023, Brasileirao_Matches contains 2012-2023(?) Let me check total matches per competition now vs before:\n- Brasileirão: 9291 → ?\n- Also check that unique matches didn't get wrongly merged: e.g., Copa do Brasil same ordered pair twice within 3 days legitimately? Let me scan for dropped matches where the kept+dropped goals differ (that would indicate possibly-different matches): compare goals of dropped vs kept. If goals differ, maybe they're different games. Let me analyze.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05abe7eab0019gx3PjNqdIr6JU","sessionID":"ses_fa54e4cfeffeF35792XylHPXI3","messageID":"msg_05abe07a5001ckBGqArmh00INs"}}
