e: World Bank - Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)\n- data/kaggle/novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv\n\nhttps://www.kaggle.com/datasets/youssefelbadry10/fifa-players-data\n- License: Apache 2.0\n- data/kaggle/fifa_data.csv\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cat README.md","time":{"start":1788229629942,"end":1788229629944}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Performance is fine: even including cold load (1.36s), a simple lookup completes well under 2s; aggregates in ms.\n\nNow update the README to document the project (it's a demo server, so usage docs matter for the evaluation). Then run the final full test suite + a fresh-venv sanity simulation.\n\nLet me read the current README fully first.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05acab7e4001MkeV5oX79w9vIV","sessionID":"ses_fa54e4cfeffeF35792XylHPXI3","messageID":"msg_05aca91e4001UVmjKTQXZsD0wY"}}
